{"id": "EUVD-2026-97595", "enisaUuid": "ddbdcfb8-c655-3c52-87ed-61ea25d0270b", "description": "Open WebUI from 0.11.0 before 0.11.4 contains an information disclosure vulnerability that allows authenticated non-admin users with tool export permission to obtain tool source code shared with them read-only. Attackers can request GET /api/v1/tools/export to retrieve the full Python source of read-only shared tools, exposing embedded API keys and credentials.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:04:53", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:44:47", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-2h26-836q-4jh2", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-webui-0.11.0-before-0.11.4-tool-source-disclosure-via-tool-export-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7rgv-j27q-wxqf", "CVE-2026-109293"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "87a3cc4f-6c8a-3bcd-857c-bc2013a551cf", "product": {"name": "open-webui", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}, "product_version": "0.11.0 <0.11.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bfd14869-78eb-3edf-9fe8-c397fbd7b8f6", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}], "isExploited": false}